Lexical eval suites for okbase-eval. Each case is a tool call Claude made in okbase's spikes
(spikes/biz-meta, spikes/embed-bench round 4), with the expected answer from those spikes. The
questions and answers are synthetic; the bundles they run on are fixtures/business and
fixtures/multilingual (see their NOTICE files).

